      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 1160,
        "content": "## New Shopify Product → Complete Ad Set → Drive + Airtable\n\n### How it works\nEvery time you add a product in Shopify, this workflow sends its page to\nCanvora, which reads it and designs a **complete ad set** — square ad,\nInstagram Story, and feed post — on brand and ready to launch. Each finished\nimage is uploaded to **Google Drive** and logged as a row in an **Airtable\nasset library** (product, format, image URL) so your creatives stay organized.\n\n### Setup steps\n- Create a free Canvora account at canvora.ai — free credits, no card — and\n  copy an API key from Integrations → API Keys (all plans).\n- In each Canvora HTTP Request node, add a **Header Auth** credential:\n  name `X-API-Key`, value your `vd_...` key.\n- Connect Shopify, Google Drive, and Airtable credentials.\n- Edit \"Build Product URL\" — replace `YOUR-STORE.myshopify.com` with your\n  store domain (or your custom domain).\n- In Airtable, point the node at your base/table with Product, Format, and\n  Image URL columns.\n\n### Customization\n- Add `ad_landscape`, `pinterest_pin`, or `facebook_post` to `outputFormats`\n  for more placements (100+ formats: GET https://api.canvora.ai/api/formats).\n- Pass a `brandId` (GET /api/brands) to lock ads to your brand kit.\n- Swap the Shopify trigger for a form or webhook to run it from any catalog.\n- Cost: 3 visuals = 30 credits per product.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
